        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: SPC XL, Microsoft Excel\n- Concepts: statistical analysis, Pareto chart, process capability, histogram, Vilfredo Pareto\n\nFacts:\n- SPC XL is a statistical add-in for Microsoft Excel.\n- SPC XL provides statistical analysis features including process capability, histogram, and Pareto chart tools.\n- A Pareto chart contains bars and a line graph, with individual values shown in descending order by the bars and the cumulative total shown by the line.\n- The Pareto chart is named after Vilfredo Pareto.",
