        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: SPC XL\n- Concepts: Pareto chart, statistical analysis\n- People: Vilfredo Pareto\n\nFacts:\n- SPC XL provides statistical analysis features including Control chart, Process capability, Histogram, Pareto chart, and ANOVA Gage R&R.\n- Vilfredo Pareto is the namesake of the Pareto chart.\n- A Pareto chart is a chart type with bars and a line graph.\n- In a Pareto chart, individual values are shown by bars in descending order, and the cumulative total is shown by the line.",
